            "NEW"
        },
        {
            "📍",
            "Good spots stay allowed",
            "When the game refused a unit, the farm compared your yen with the unit's base price, not the price this mode charges. A refusal for short yen counted against the spot, and after two runs the spot was blocked on that map for good. Now the real price is used, a refusal the game explains with yen or a limit leaves the spot alone, and a blocked spot is tried again after 7 days.",
